                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b3167da8-bfe4-3123-b629-aa3e80917887",
                        "entry_id": "e771f12f-dfb1-3b21-bdb4-93f0e9acf8d5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "физ., техн. обусловленный поверхностным сцеплением"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ce8bb27-6938-4e73-a7a0-153891457820",
                                "sense_id": "b3167da8-bfe4-3123-b629-aa3e80917887",
                                "text": "Разрушения во всех случаях были когезионными (образец разрывался) и происходили при растяжении от 100 до 146%."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "50155304-558e-4326-8573-d48f8f3beaec",
                        "source_entry_id": "e771f12f-dfb1-3b21-bdb4-93f0e9acf8d5",
                        "source_sense_id": "b3167da8-bfe4-3123-b629-aa3e80917887",
                        "target_lang_word": "cohesion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cohesion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb49efa8-fea3-3dff-a59a-16f53760a04a",
                                        "entry_id": "59722014-7814-3864-8068-c9acce08a743",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "State of cohering, or of working together."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "259a97b7-260e-4f20-a883-aecec30f8d16",
                                                "sense_id": "bb49efa8-fea3-3dff-a59a-16f53760a04a",
                                                "text": "Unit cohesion is important in the military."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58847954-4fb0-4b2b-a0d2-5d6274ed64b6",
                                                "sense_id": "bb49efa8-fea3-3dff-a59a-16f53760a04a",
                                                "text": "For divers reasons, the capitalist class lacks this cohesion or solidarity, chief among which is the optimism bred of past success. And, again, the capitalist class is divided; it has within itself a class struggle of no mean proportions, which tends to irritate and harass it and to confuse the situation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c724036-2476-3d29-8270-760526b0b594",
                                        "entry_id": "59722014-7814-3864-8068-c9acce08a743",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Various intermolecular forces that hold solids and liquids together."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61bd1986-0529-3415-a7cb-c4fa8b726e96",
                                        "entry_id": "59722014-7814-3864-8068-c9acce08a743",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Growing together of normally distinct parts of a plant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ecf54ad-aa02-3a32-af2b-2e3bbe6f6580",
                                        "entry_id": "59722014-7814-3864-8068-c9acce08a743",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Degree to which functionally related elements in a system belong together."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "156d2406-b150-4aa3-a82b-e967fc88caf7",
                                                "sense_id": "8ecf54ad-aa02-3a32-af2b-2e3bbe6f6580",
                                                "text": "In general, it is neither advisable nor possible to create such maximally cohesive classes; on the other hand, we would like cohesion to be high. When cohesion is high, it means that the methods and variables of the class are co-dependent and hang together as a logical whole."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4bdb4002-2d57-3889-8be6-e56d0271fd66",
                                        "entry_id": "59722014-7814-3864-8068-c9acce08a743",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Grammatical or lexical relationship between different parts of the same text."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "93c3efde-50f6-4d17-bc86-86bc78c3772c",
                        "source_entry_id": "e771f12f-dfb1-3b21-bdb4-93f0e9acf8d5",
                        "source_sense_id": "b3167da8-bfe4-3123-b629-aa3e80917887",
                        "target_lang_word": "cohesive",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cohesive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25011def-69b6-3009-82ff-179e13a6aa1b",
                                        "entry_id": "abd3e5f8-b3e0-3629-9e5d-fd983f49794f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having cohesion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1093db00-c16f-4ebf-9be5-7fa6a658dbbd",
                                                "sense_id": "25011def-69b6-3009-82ff-179e13a6aa1b",
                                                "text": "Our object is to unite all the manifestations of the New Era into one cohesive whole—New Thought, Christian Science, Theosophy, Vedanta, Bahaism, and the other sparks from the one New Light."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fdbb84b-dfc1-4d73-8a95-f0b2f407dc87",
                                                "sense_id": "25011def-69b6-3009-82ff-179e13a6aa1b",
                                                "text": "Maloney’s moment of magic ensured they did not. For Scotland, who produced the best of what cohesive football there was on the night, it was a merited outcome."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b31ff51-0214-4ffb-805e-59bc3464274d",
                                                "sense_id": "25011def-69b6-3009-82ff-179e13a6aa1b",
                                                "text": "“It was presented as a cohesive worldview that you could maintain if you studied the Bible,” she told me. “Part of that was that climate change isn’t real, that evolution is a myth made up by scientists who hate God, and capitalism is God’s ideal for society.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c612910-98cb-404e-9226-380504be07f3",
                                                "sense_id": "25011def-69b6-3009-82ff-179e13a6aa1b",
                                                "text": "The idea of loyalty to a single country and culture, particularly in East Asia, may also “imply the desire to maintain a cohesive ethnocultural identity,” said Dzankic, of GLOBALCIT."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "cohesive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ca1f232-02ce-370f-9f80-89349ebddd5d",
                                        "entry_id": "7434fc3d-4f14-30de-9384-a6e3d8cd107b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A substance that provides cohesion"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aef7f194-9433-463d-bb2c-78a0a725d6da",
                                                "sense_id": "3ca1f232-02ce-370f-9f80-89349ebddd5d",
                                                "text": "The thesaurus (Chapman, 1977) lists two pages of mechanical tools, two pages of joining functions, and a half page of adhesives, binders, and cohesives used to build or repair consumer goods."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d87b0e7-6b44-4ca1-9277-e1b79faf15d9",
                                                "sense_id": "3ca1f232-02ce-370f-9f80-89349ebddd5d",
                                                "text": "Direct comparison meta-analysis showed that viscoadaptives lead to a lower loss in cell density compared with very low viscosity dispersives, and compared with super viscous cohesives."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e93619d-216a-3564-9b02-e3789a027988",
                                        "entry_id": "7434fc3d-4f14-30de-9384-a6e3d8cd107b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device used to establish cohesion within a text"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ef4bc3b-0a4f-454f-a4a1-321930645a41",
                                                "sense_id": "5e93619d-216a-3564-9b02-e3789a027988",
                                                "text": "The fourth of this group of cohesives is the anaphoric, same UT."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
